 "introductions": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "13のフレームアニメーションシーンと女のコの妖精のフルボイス作品です。",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "妖精が君のガーデンのスペシャルな植物を守る為に家へ引っ越して来たぞ。<br />\n<br />\n彼女の名前はイザベラ。神聖なレインボーフルーツを守る為にやって来た。君の助けが必要だ。<br />\n彼女に家の中を案内し、彼女との関係を構築しよう。もしかしたら、もっと親密になれるかも?<br />\n<br />\nこのキネティックノベルで、君は小さな妖精と親密になる事が出来る!悪魔のゴブリンと戦う為の君のファイティングスキルを試そう!<br />\n<br />\n13のフレームアニメーションシーンと女のコの妖精のフルボイス作品です。<br />\n<br />\n<br />\nA fairy has moved into your home to protect something special growing in your garden. <br />\n<br />\nHer name is Isabella and she is here to protect the sacred rainbow fruit; and to do that she will need your help. Give her a tour of your home and get to know her and perhaps your relationship with her will go to the next level. <br />\n<br />\nIn this kinetic novel you'll experience what it's like to get closer to and have intimate relations with a pint sized fairy! You'll also put your skills to the test fighting evil goblins that are up to no good with arcade style levels! <br />\n<br />\nThis game includes thirteen frame by frame animated scenes and a fully voiced female fairy!"
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
